"第 2 步：配置 HTTPS 解密" = "Step 2: Configure HTTPS Decryption";
"进入“配置 → 本地文件”，找到带黄点的配置，点击右侧 i 图标。" = "Go to Config → Local Files, find the config with the yellow dot, and tap the i icon on the right.";
